  },
  {
   "text": "Brihat Jataka",
   "bbox": [
    1284,
    301,
    1578,
    334
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "of use to many. One born in \"Shool\" yoga is valiant and suffers",
   "bbox": [
    358,
    394,
    1580,
    448
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "from injury, given to persuit of wealth but is not rich.",
   "bbox": [
    355,
    451,
    1431,
    493
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Yuga, Gol etc",
   "bbox": [
    352,
    550,
    708,
    597
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "धनविरहित: पाखण्डी वा युगे त्वथ गोलके",
   "bbox": [
    427,
    628,
    1060,
    688
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "विधनमालिनो ज्ञानोपेत: कुशिल्प्यलसोऽटन:।",
   "bbox": [
    429,
    696,
    1062,
    751
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "इति निगदिता योगा: सार्द्धं फलैरिह नाभसा।",
   "bbox": [
    428,
    760,
    1063,
    813
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "नियतफलदाश्चिन्त्या होते समस्तदशास्वपि।। 19 ।।",
   "bbox": [
    428,
    826,
    1186,
    880
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "One born in \"Yuga\" yoga is devoid of health and a deceiver,",
   "bbox": [
    426,
    921,
    1571,
    971
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "one born in \"Gol\" yoga is poor, unclean, without knowledge,",
   "bbox": [
    350,
    971,
    1571,
    1024
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "engaged in petty artisan work and lazy. Thus I have explained",
   "bbox": [
    347,
    1024,
    1572,
    1077
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Nabhas yogas with their results. These results are experienced",
   "bbox": [
    346,
    1077,
    1571,
    1129
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "as stated in the dasas of planets.",
   "bbox": [
    346,
    1129,
    1007,
    1178
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "इति श्रीवराहमिहिरकृते बृहज्जातके नाभस् योगाध्याय: द्वादश: ।।12।।",
   "bbox": [
    467,
    1335,
    1443,
    1393
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Thus ends the twelfth chapter on Nabhas yogas in Brihat",
